  "summary": "rand is unsound (undefined behavior via an aliased mutable reference) when the log and thread_rng features are enabled, a custom logger calls a TryRng method on ThreadRng obtained via rand::rng(), and ThreadRng reseeds during that logger call. Affects rand::rng() in >=0.9.0 and rand::thread_rng() in >=0.7.0,<0.10.0. Fixed starting with 0.9.3 (RUSTSEC-2026-0097, GHSA-cq8v-f236-94qc).",
